WEBVTT

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:01.970
Here we go!

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:04.160
Thank you for watching!

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:20.710
What are you going to do?

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.040
Nozomi!

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.240
Kurumi is right.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:24.660
I have to be careful.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:26.120
Are you okay?

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.660
Thank you for watching!

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:42.540
Come on!

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:44.530
Oh...

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.060
Nozomi...

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.980
I told you to be careful, didn't I?

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:55.970
Don't listen to what people say like that.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:00:59.340
Thank you for watching!

00:00:59.460 --> 00:00:59.840
I

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.440
I will never take care of Nozomi again.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:04.750
No way!

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:06.840
Well, of course.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:00.200
You

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:52.790
Shibiretta-san.

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:56.020
I haven't received any reports yet, but...

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:56.760
It's on the desk.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:07.710
Precure and Milky Rose need to be all together to show their strength, so we need to split them up.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:09.960
Well...

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:11.610
It's something that anyone can think of.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.790
It's a different level of thinking and being able to implement it.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.350
This is a job only I can do.

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:21.830
Do your best.

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:23.770
Don't let the captain down.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.020
Did I say too much?

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.600
That's the look on your face.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:53.550
Yeah, is that so?

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.580
Nozomi wants me to do this.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:59.960
It's okay, Nozomi.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.080
Rin's feelings have been conveyed to me.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:05.110
Rin-chan, I brought orange juice.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:17.690
It's the presence of Palmin.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:28.310
It's heading towards the town. Be careful!

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:49.150
Ha ha ha, young ladies. I'll invite you to my wonderful world.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:08.620
Huh? What are these clothes?

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.100
And what is this place?

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.790
Could it be...

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.300
Like the other day,

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.900
you were invited into a strange world, weren't you?

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:19.180
Huh? Urara!

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.740
It's a leather bag, isn't it?

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:29.800
That's...

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:31.980
That's why we have to chase after Falmy.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.740
Besides, we have to find a way to get out of here.

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:42.020
I lost her.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:44.020
She was here a while ago.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.780
I'm sure she's still nearby.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.100
Jack and the Bean Tree?

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.670
Isn't it coming?

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:10.760
Yeah, that's the mist that flew out after chasing Palmy.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:11.700
That's...

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:12.830
Did something happen?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.360
Syrup, did you see Nozomi and the others?

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.010
No, we didn't see them.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.830
Did something happen?

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.170
Actually, for a moment, I had a bad feeling.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:24.290
What?

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:25.220
You too?

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:28.530
But that feeling disappeared immediately.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:29.960
Could it be...

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.830
You might have been invited.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.840
I have to go find it quickly.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:36.820
Siro!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:37.340
What?

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:48.580
If you climb the tree of beans, there's a giant living there, right?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.260
That's right!

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:50.610
With that giant!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:51.990
Onigashima!

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:53.170
Onigashima!

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:55.220
I'm going to be Momotaro in the middle.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.380
Oh, really?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.580
I'm going to be Momotaro in the middle.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:06:59.980
I'm going to be Momotaro in the middle.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:07.790
To put it simply, the titan stole the chicken with the golden egg, so Jack has to take it back!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:11.620
That means the titan has Palmy, right?

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.380
That's right.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.030
Alright, let's go to the titan's house!

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:24.820
Alright, I'll do something about it!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:25.860
That's right.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:28.420
You're so stubborn.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:29.860
It can't be helped.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.760
Both of you, it's dangerous so don't be reckless!

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:55.240
I'm telling you something weird!

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.790
Don't go play!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.780
Nozomi, put your foot in there.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.690
I got it.

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:18.610
Really be careful.

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.350
Otherwise, Nozomi will be in danger.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:21.490
Yes.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:36.000
It's up there!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.550
That's amazing.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:38.980
Don't be impressed.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.400
Let's look for the titan's house.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:48.580
It's up there.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.260
It's up there.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.940
There should be a titan's house here, right?

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.170
Could it be...

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:55.470
Titan!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:04.170
Does that mean this is the entrance?

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:15.100
Don't ring the doorbell! What if the titans notice us?

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.140
I see...

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:20.190
No! We can't reach you!

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:24.940
You don't have to ring the doorbell!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.200
Yes...

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.300
But... What should we do?

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:29.840
This is...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:30.540
How do you do it?

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:33.360
Everyone, over here!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:34.340
Huh?

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.580
Pyo!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.440
Eh? From there?

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:39.530
It looks like a mouse.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:46.220
Is this the house of the titans?

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:57.640
Next...

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.680
Are you going to take it back from someone like this?

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:01.300
I'm a little scared.

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.530
What? There's nothing to be scared of.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:12.110
What is this sound?

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.190
Isn't it a squeak?

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:14.910
The titan is asleep.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:16.920
Now's the chance!

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.240
Before the titan wakes up, I'll get the Palmin back.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:21.620
All right!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.100
And I'll kick you!

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.380
Yuto, you're great!

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.480
Is there any way to get out of here?

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:44.010
What if we can't get in touch with Nozomi and the others?

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.840
Nozomi and the others are the only ones we can do this with!

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:53.310
Let's look for them again!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:03.500
So, is it okay if we don't transform?

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.940
Yeah, we're not all together, so I don't think it's a good idea to stimulate them unnecessarily.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:13.450
Right now, we just have to think about shooting Parumin and going back quickly.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.000
That's right. Then, let's look for Parumin.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:30.480
Let's go!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:30.980
Be quiet!

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:31.580
Huh?

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:43.220
Stop it!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:54.760
Alright, I'll shoot.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.220
It's so delicious!

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:09.410
Welcome, ladies.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.600
Oh, no.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:32.350
I want it!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:36.030
Let's get out of here!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:40.150
No! If that Palmin is the king, we have to shoot him!

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:43.410
That's right, but we can't do it now!

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:44.850
Nozomi, come here!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:45.850
Nozomi!

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.150
Give Palmin back!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.200
I want it!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.420
Kanaika!

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:33.280
The power of hope!

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:35.360
Cure Dream!

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:40.800
I can't-

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:10.640
We'll be right back.

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:13.550
It's a-

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:31.070
Yellow!

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:37.060
Oh, so you're going to turn your back on me?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:41.160
If you don't get everyone together, it'll be tough to face me!

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:42.660
I want you!

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:46.740
I want you!

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:53.670
Now, if you don't want to be trampled down,

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:56.390
then quietly, Rose P-

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:57.300
Die!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:00.860
Thank you for watching!

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:01.590
I'm here to take it back!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:03.120
Doreen!

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:05.200
Huh?

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.710
I'm losing my sense of smell around here, Roppun.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.370
Could this be...

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:16.160
Ehe

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:36.590
It's delicious.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:39.780
I haven't heard of udon yet.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:41.220
Shut up!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:50.430
It's okay.

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:51.370
Thank you.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:53.590
It's delicious.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.800
But it's dangerous, isn't it?

00:16:58.800 --> 00:16:59.800
And...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.200
Yuji, you stopped taking care of Dream, right?

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:09.660
I'm doing my best to keep my promise with Flora.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:13.580
I'll always follow Dream, wherever and whenever.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:15.760
Rouge!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:21.190
I love dreams where I'm doing my best for someone.

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:40.920
You won't be able to do anything if you don't get all of you together.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.600
Now, give up on Rosbuck and me!

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:46.600
The opponent is too huge!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:48.720
Even a big guy like him...

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:49.410
I'm sure of it.

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:52.050
I think there's a weakness to it, but...

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:53.480
Thank you for watching!

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:05.100
That looks so good!

00:18:06.170 --> 00:18:07.150
Oh, that one!

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:08.650
Alright!

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:10.090
I want it!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:11.980
I WANT IT!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:13.700
HAAAAAAA-

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:15.020
Alright!

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:33.810
Yeah.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:37.540
The two of us are a great combination, aren't we?

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:38.740
We're perfect for each other!

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.210
We can't afford to lose.

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:41.940
We're going, too!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:42.360
Yes!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:43.720
Oshii-na!

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:45.450
Oshii-na?

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:46.270
Huh?!

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:20.820
I thought I'd be able to do it, but it's all thanks to Rin-chan.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:26.150
I was worried about you.

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:29.210
After all, Rin did something for me.

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.590
You did something, didn't you, Urara?

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.250
You two were amazing.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:38.090
Yeah, it's all thanks to me.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.740
But I lost Palmyon.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:44.080
Yeah.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:05.420
Give it back to Rose Pact!

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:07.140
Got it.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:16.470
Hey, Taro!

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:21.170
What are you doing?

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:24.090
You've been so reliable for a while.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.510
What are you doing with your healthy face, Taro?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:27.060
You've been worrying about me all the time, Taro.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.000
My body...

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:31.750
Thank you for worrying about me, Lolo.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:34.600
I'll take care of you until I get better, Lolo.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.940
Take it easy, okay?

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:36.960
Hey, you guys!

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:40.340
I've been watching you guys for a long time, Lolo.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:41.350
Especially you!

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:46.080
You followed me well, so I was able to get through this, Lolo.

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:49.020
You're so noisy, Lopo.

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:50.320
You're so talkative.

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:51.950
Really.

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:53.410
You're going to be my friend.

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:01.040
Thank you.

00:23:47.470 --> 00:23:47.990
This is the world that was created by Eternals.

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:53.490
Anyway, all of them are...

00:24:00.480 --> 00:24:01.510
Yes! Urikyo Five!

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:01.900
Let's go!

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:04.080
My house of sweets!
